# [PC] the speaker text (CScriptSpeaker -> IPP::setOverlayText) on the
# tutorial map, 1280x720, 60 fps clock:
#   SDL_VIDEODRIVER=offscreen ./build-game/ProjectY --data data --skirmish 201 \
#       --frames 700 --input tools/ui/ingame_tutorial_text.input
# The first text pauses the game until it is dismissed (Enter / Space / a
# click); the tutorial then goes on with its next text.
300 screenshot ingame_tutorial_1.png
310 key return                         # dismiss: the script is done, the game resumes
400 screenshot ingame_tutorial_2.png
410 click left 640 400                 # a click dismisses as well
600 screenshot ingame_tutorial_3.png
